   "source": [
    "### Comparacion de metodos numericos"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "90b27279-31f1-4c3d-b7b3-c4181319eb75",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "En nuestro problema tenemos una temperatura a las 12 pm que definiremos como tiempo 0 entonces nuestro punto inicial es (0,80), nuestro objetivo es calcular el otro punto que nos dan que es (1,75)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "65260974-e754-4bcf-be17-f567c7c720c4",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "**Metodo de euler:**"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 16,
   "id": "1ac273d9-34e8-45d9-a8cd-5a55be4b5028",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n",
    "import math\n",
    "\n",
    "def euler(f, t0, y0, h, n):\n",
    "    \"\"\"\n",
    "    Versión mínima para visualizar puntos del método de Euler\n",
    "    \"\"\"\n",
    "    \n",
    "    t = [t0]\n",
    "    y = [y0]\n",
    "    \n",
    "    # Calcular todos los puntos\n",
    "    for _ in range(n):\n",
    "        t_nuevo = t[-1] + h\n",
    "        y_nuevo = y[-1] + h * f(t[-1], y[-1])\n",
    "        t.append(t_nuevo)\n",
    "        y.append(y_nuevo)\n",
    "    \n",
    "    # Gráfico simple\n",
    "    plt.figure(figsize=(9, 5))\n",
    "    \n",
    "    # Puntos\n",
    "    plt.scatter(t, y, color='red', s=100, alpha=0.8, label='Puntos Euler', zorder=3)\n",
    "    \n",
    "    # Línea entre puntos (opcional)\n",
    "    plt.plot(t, y, 'b--', alpha=0.5, linewidth=1)\n",
    "    \n",
    "    # Configurar gráfico\n",
    "    plt.xlabel('t')\n",
    "    plt.ylabel('y(t)')\n",
    "    plt.title(f'Método de Euler - {n} pasos, h={h}')\n",
    "    plt.grid(True, alpha=0.3)\n",
    "    plt.legend()\n",
    "    \n",
    "    # Mostrar coordenadas de cada punto\n",
    "    for i, (ti, yi) in enumerate(zip(t, y)):\n",
    "        plt.text(ti, yi + 0.05, f'({ti:.2f}, {yi:.2f})', \n",
    "                ha='center', fontsize=8)\n",
    "    \n",
    "    plt.show()\n",
    "    \n",
    "    return t, y"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "73be3317-2ac8-4183-9dbe-5c19e24cebad",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Definimos nuestra edo del problema,el tamano del paso y numero de pasos"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 18,
   "id": "28e58456-a121-41eb-823f-9e192c76a01d",
